# Contact form delivery (Web3Forms) — optional but recommended.
#
# Without this key the contact form still works: it opens a prefilled email
# draft the visitor sends themselves. With it, messages land in your inbox.
#
# How to get one (free, no account needed):
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter jamadigal@gmail.com in the "Create Access Key" box
#   3. Check your email for the access key
#   4. Copy it below into a file named .env.local (NOT this example file)
#   5. Add the same variable in Vercel: Project > Settings > Environment Variables
#
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
